        'rawContent': "{{Scientific Principle Information|\n|name = Ralek\n|field = Biology\n|subfield = Zoology / Xenobiology\n|classification = Pack-Hunting Saurian\n|principles = Labyrinthine lung structure, subterranean burrowing\n|applications = Domesticated hunting companion, Pest control\n|status = Indigenous Wildlife\n}}\n\n'''Ralek''' are a large herd creature native to [[Lorithan]]. The largest herds were found in the Plains of Zysk prior to the [[Burning Wars]]. They now exist in limited numbers only in the [[Dzarning Mountain Range]], or on the world of [[Ipsoff]].\n\n[[Category:Animals]]\n[[Category:Scientific Principles]]\n[[Category:Science]]"
