        'rawContent': "'''Materials''' refers to solid matter used in construction and engineering. Materials can be naturally-occurring, such as stone; or they can be artificially designed, such as permacrete.\n\n[[Category:Chemistry]]\n[[Category:Scientific Principles]]\n[[Category:Science]]"
