        'rawContent': "'''Drugs''' has a wide range of meanings. It can include medicines and treatments for medical conditions, harmful compounds for killing or disabling people, or \"recreational\" compounds for altering the consciousness of an intelligent being.\n\n[[Category:Chemistry]]\n[[Category:Scientific Principles]]\n[[Category:Science]]"
